# UX SOVEREIGNTY: INFINITY PROTOCOL v6.2

> Consolidates `ux_lead.mdc` + `ui_ux_mastery.mdc`. One rule, absolute authority.

## 1. VISUAL LANGUAGE — LIQUID GLASS (Non-Negotiable)
```tsx
// ✅ The standard Liquid Glass card
<div className="backdrop-blur-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
```
- **Glassmorphism**: `backdrop-blur-xl` + `bg-white/5` + `border-white/10`. Always.
- **Colors**: REJECT generic Tailwind (`zinc`, `slate`, `gray` defaults). Use HSL/variable-driven palettes with deep contrast.
- **Typography**: Inter or Geist. `tracking-tight` (`-0.02em`). No browser defaults.
- **Bento Grid**: 12-column. Every element is a cell. No freeform layouts.

## 2. MOTION PHYSICS — FRAMER MOTION
```tsx
// ✅ Standard spring — feel alive, not mechanical
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 16 }}
  animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
  transition={{ type: "spring", stiffness: 100, damping: 15 }}
/>
```
- **60fps mandatory**. Test on real devices, not just localhost.
- **300ms** is the transition sweet spot. Never exceed 500ms for UI feedback.
- **`<AnimatePresence>`** for all mount/unmount transitions. No abrupt DOM changes.
- **Hover**: `scale-105` or glow. **Click**: `scale-95` depress. Both mandatory on interactive elements.

## 3. MOBILE SOVEREIGNTY
- **Touch targets**: Minimum 44×44px. Non-negotiable.
- **Safe area**: Always `safe-area-inset-*` for notched devices.
- **Mobile-first**: Design for `375px` first. Scale up with `md:` / `lg:`.
- **Gestures**: Support swipe-to-back and pull-to-refresh where applicable.
- **Testing**: Capture UI state with `browser_snapshot` before AND after any UI mutation.

## 4. ACCESSIBILITY (WCAG AA)
- **Contrast ratio**: ≥ 4.5:1 for body text, ≥ 3:1 for large text.
- **Focus rings**: Visible for all keyboard-navigable elements.
- **ARIA**: Semantic HTML + `aria-label` on all interactive elements.
- **Reduced motion**: Wrap animations in `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)`.

## 5. DESIGN SYSTEM SOVEREIGNTY
- Figma variables → Tailwind CSS custom properties only. No `style={{}}`.
- Map: `Primary Color` → `text-primary/bg-primary`, `Corner Radius 12` → `rounded-xl`, `Auto Layout` → `flex/gap-x`.
- Before replicating a Dribbble/Figma reference: analyze **light source**, **shadow depth**, **corner smoothing** — then replicate the *feeling*, not just metrics.

## 6. ANTI-PATTERNS (Instant Reject)
- ❌ `style={{}}` inline styles — use Tailwind classes
- ❌ Generic color names (`gray-500`, `zinc-800`) without design token
- ❌ `linear` easing — use `spring` physics
- ❌ Animations > 500ms for critical path UI
- ❌ Missing `alt` on images, missing `aria-label` on icon buttons
